#, fuzzy
msgid "Viking boats were built of overlapping planks, held with iron rivets."
msgstr "كانت قوارب الفايكنغ تُبنى من ألواح متراكبة، مثبّتة بمسامير حديدية."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
