#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/049_the_runestone/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"I will raise a runestone for my mother. The stone comes from the quarry by Bergö, and the "
"runecarver needs iron chisels from the smith. The stone is so big, it takes three crates of room!"
msgstr ""
"سأنصب حجرًا رونيًّا لأمّي. الحجر يأتي من المقلع قرب بيرغو، والنقّاش يحتاج إلى أزاميل حديدية من "
"الحدّاد. الحجر كبير جدًا، يأخذ مكان ثلاثة صناديق!"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/049_the_runestone/mission.json
